{\b\f1 Roster}\par
Build a roster of people once, then drag it onto any event in your calendar to see who's missing and add them with one confirmation.\par
\par
Roster is read-only by design: it never removes or edits existing invitees, and it never RSVPs on your behalf. Everything stays on this Mac \'97 rosters live in a folder you choose, and attendee changes are made locally through Calendar.app.\par
